@startuml
title Pati — 3D Pet Asset Üretim Pipeline'ı
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
queue "3D Job Queue" as Q
component "Input Validator" as IV
component "Pet Segmentation" as SEG
component "Multi-view Reconstruction" as REC
component "Species Shape Prior" as PRIOR
component "Mesh Cleanup" as MC
component "UV Unwrap" as UV
component "Texture Synthesis" as TEX
component "Fur / Coat Generator" as FUR
component "Auto Rigging" as RIG
component "Animation Retarget" as ANIM
component "LOD / Compression" as LOD
component "Quality Evaluator" as QE
component "Human Review" as HR
database "Model / Prompt Registry" as MR
database "Versioned 3D Assets" as AS
Q --> IV
IV --> SEG
SEG --> REC
PRIOR --> REC : tür/ırk morfoloji prior
REC --> MC
MC --> UV
UV --> TEX
TEX --> FUR
MC --> RIG
RIG --> ANIM
FUR --> LOD
ANIM --> LOD
LOD --> QE
MR --> SEG
MR --> REC
MR --> TEX
MR --> RIG
QE --> AS : kalite eşiği geçti
QE --> HR : düşük güven / anatomi sorunu
HR --> Q : düzeltme maskesiyle yeniden üret
note bottom
Çıktılar: GLB/glTF master, mobil LOD0–LOD2, thumbnail,
texture atlas, skeleton, blendshape ve provenance manifest.
Kalite: siluet/renk benzerliği, anatomi, mesh bütünlüğü,
UV seam, rig deformasyonu, dosya boyutu ve cihaz FPS.
end note
@enduml
